Encoding: UTF-8
Package: swehist
Title: Swedish Historical Administrative Boundaries
Version: 1.1.1
Authors@R: person("Johan", "Junkka", email = "johan.junkka@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1527-279X"))
Description: Swedish historical administrative boundaries, hierarchies,
    and matching tools for 11 administrative types (parishes, counties,
    municipalities, and more) 1600-1990. Based on data from Riksarkivet
    (Swedish National Archives). The code is licensed MIT and the data
    CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE.md in the source repository).
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
License: MIT + file LICENSE
